TI  - The rise of Indian summer monsoon precipitation extremes and its correlation with long-term changes of climate and anthropogenic factors
T2  - SCIENTIFIC REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - AEROSOL IMPACTS
KW  - RAINFALL
KW  - TRENDS
KW  - VARIABILITY
KW  - EVENTS
